{"format":"rerail.policy/v1","id":"eslint:no-alert","revision":1,"mode":"steer","description":"Port of ESLint's `no-alert` rule (https://eslint.org/docs/latest/rules/no-alert). Flags calls of alert, confirm and prompt when not shadowed, or as members of an unshadowed window, of globalThis when the configured ecmaVersion or globals declare it, or of `this` in the global scope of a script. Names are resolved with `resolves` under the case's `ast.languageOptions`; alert/confirm/prompt and window test shadowing only (`declared: false`), and only globalThis honours `/* global */` comments.","scope":{"include":["**/*"],"exclude":[]},"clauses":[{"id":"alert","forbid":{"ast":{"language":"typescript","languageOptions":{},"rule":{"kind":"call_expression","has":{"matches":"callee"}},"utils":{"global-obj":{"any":[{"kind":"identifier","resolves":{"global":["window"],"declared":false}},{"kind":"identifier","resolves":{"global":["globalThis"],"directives":"eslint"}},{"kind":"this","resolves":{"this":"globalScope"}},{"kind":"parenthesized_expression","has":{"matches":"global-obj"}}]},"callee":{"any":[{"kind":"identifier","pattern":"$NAME","resolves":{"global":["alert","confirm","prompt"],"declared":false}},{"kind":"member_expression","all":[{"has":{"kind":"property_identifier","regex":"^(alert|confirm|prompt)$","pattern":"$NAME"}},{"has":{"matches":"global-obj"}}]},{"kind":"subscript_expression","all":[{"has":{"any":[{"kind":"string"},{"kind":"template_string","not":{"has":{"kind":"template_substitution"}}}],"has":{"kind":"string_fragment","regex":"^(alert|confirm|prompt)$","pattern":"$NAME"}}},{"has":{"matches":"global-obj"}}]},{"kind":"parenthesized_expression","has":{"matches":"callee"}}]}}}},"violation":{"anchor":"witness.span","code":"NO_ALERT","message":"Unexpected $NAME."}}]}